{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":486905,"name":"BG","username":"BG1","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/b/2acd7d/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-09T01:10:25.192Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-486905-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-486905-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-486905-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-486905-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSummary\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nConnecting Robinhood Agentic Trading MCP (\u003ccode\u003ehttps://agent.robinhood.com/mcp/trading\u003c/code\u003e) from Grok Bot fails after successful Robinhood login + consent. Connector stays \u003ccode\u003eneedsAuth\u003c/code\u003e with 0 tools.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSteps\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAdd custom MCP: \u003ccode\u003ehttps://agent.robinhood.com/mcp/trading\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStart Authenticate / connect card from Grok Bot\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSign in to Robinhood; see “Cursor wants to access Robinhood”; tap Allow\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLand on \u003ccode\u003erobinhood.com/oauth/error\u003c/code\u003e (“unexpected error connecting this application”)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eExpected\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nConnector becomes connected with trading tools.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eActual\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthorize URL uses \u003ccode\u003eredirect_uri=grokbot://mcp/oauth/callback\u003c/code\u003e. After Allow, OAuth errors; status remains needsAuth / tools=0. Retried Aug 31, Sep 1, Sep 7, Sep 8 — same failure.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEnvironment\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nGrok Bot (cloud). Robinhood Agentic Trading MCP. Feedback already sent to SpaceXAI/Cursor team with reply requested; no ETA yet.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAsk\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nPlease allowlist / fix Grok Bot’s \u003ccode\u003egrokbot://mcp/oauth/callback\u003c/code\u003e for Robinhood OAuth, or document a working path. Looking for status/ETA.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-486905-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-486905-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAdd custom MCP: \u003ccode\u003ehttps://agent.robinhood.com/mcp/trading\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStart Authenticate / connect card from Grok Bot\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSign in to Robinhood; see “Cursor wants to access Robinhood”; tap Allow\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLand on \u003ccode\u003erobinhood.com/oauth/error\u003c/code\u003e (“unexpected error connecting this application”)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-486905-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-486905-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConnector becomes connected with trading tools.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-486905-operating-system-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-486905-operating-system-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOther\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-486905-version-information-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-486905-version-information-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot (cloud); Robinhood Agentic Trading MCP\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-486905-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-7\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-486905-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-7\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNo - Cursor works, but with this issue\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":2,"updated_at":"2026-09-09T01:10:32.853Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":35,"reads":3,"readers_count":2,"score":120.6,"yours":false,"topic_id":171111,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-robinhood-agentic-trading-mcp-oauth-fails-after-allow-grokbot-callback-oauth-error","display_username":"BG","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":136918,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-robinhood-agentic-trading-mcp-oauth-fails-after-allow-grokbot-callback-oauth-error/171111/1","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false},{"id":487017,"name":"Dean Rie","username":"deanrie","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/deanrie/{size}/1263_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-09T04:16:38.731Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHey, \u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/bg1\"\u003e@BG1\u003c/a\u003e, thanks for the detailed report. There are two separate things here.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFirst, the \u003ccode\u003egrokbot://mcp/oauth/callback\u003c/code\u003e you saw is no longer what we send. Since 7 September, Robinhood sign-in from Grok Bot uses a normal \u003ccode\u003ehttps://www.cursor.com/agents/...\u003c/code\u003e callback, so the part about allowlisting \u003ccode\u003egrokbot://\u003c/code\u003e is basically not relevant anymore.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSecond, your attempt on the evening of 7 September did come back from Robinhood with an authorisation, but it arrived about 17 minutes after the start. The sign-in request is only valid for a short window of time, about 15 minutes. That’s why we rejected it as expired on our side, not because of \u003ccode\u003eoauth/error\u003c/code\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePlease try again like this:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIn Grok Bot on your phone, open the Robinhood connector and tap Authenticate.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eComplete the Robinhood login, any device approval, and tap Allow within a couple of minutes of starting. If Robinhood asks you to approve the device in its app, do that first, then restart from step 1.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIf you land on \u003ccode\u003erobinhood.com/oauth/error\u003c/code\u003e again, copy the full authorise URL from the browser. It starts with \u003ccode\u003eagent.robinhood.com\u003c/code\u003e or \u003ccode\u003erobinhood.com\u003c/code\u003e and includes \u003ccode\u003eredirect_uri=\u003c/code\u003e. Send it here, along with the exact time you tapped Allow.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf it still won’t work on your phone, the most reliable path right now is to connect Robinhood once from Grok Bot desktop on Mac or Windows, or from Cursor on a computer, using the same account. Connectors are stored on the account, so the trading tools will then show up in Grok Bot on your phone too.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLet me know how it goes.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":5,"post_type":1,"posts_count":2,"updated_at":"2026-09-09T04:16:38.731Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":1,"reads":2,"readers_count":1,"score":0.4,"yours":false,"topic_id":171111,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-robinhood-agentic-trading-mcp-oauth-fails-after-allow-grokbot-callback-oauth-error","display_username":"Dean Rie","primary_group_name":"CursorStaff","flair_name":"CursorStaff","flair_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/a/d/ad08adc640929ae1e98be69dab1ad0844cee99a0.png","flair_bg_color":"","flair_color":"","flair_group_id":42,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":"","bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":true,"admin":true,"staff":true,"user_id":750,"hidden":false,"trust_level":4,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-robinhood-agentic-trading-mcp-oauth-fails-after-allow-grokbot-callback-oauth-error/171111/5","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null}],"stream":[486905,487017]},"timeline_lookup":[[1,2]],"suggested_topics":[],"tags":[{"id":47,"name":"mcp","slug":"mcp"},{"id":416,"name":"grok-bot","slug":"grok-bot"},{"id":305,"name":"login","slug":"login"}],"tags_descriptions":{},"fancy_title":"Grok Bot: Robinhood Agentic Trading MCP OAuth fails after Allow (grokbot:// callback / oauth/error)","id":171111,"title":"Grok Bot: Robinhood Agentic Trading MCP OAuth fails after Allow (grokbot:// callback / oauth/error)","posts_count":2,"created_at":"2026-09-09T01:10:25.126Z","views":43,"reply_count":0,"like_count":0,"last_posted_at":"2026-09-09T04:16:38.731Z","visible":true,"closed":false,"archived":false,"has_summary":false,"archetype":"regular","slug":"grok-bot-robinhood-agentic-trading-mcp-oauth-fails-after-allow-grokbot-callback-oauth-error","category_id":6,"word_co